# Fridge (issues 034, 099, from the fridge photo): brushed-steel two-door fridge seen near top-down like the stove: a thin strip of the doors with their handles and a round badge along the top, then the steel top with the humidifier, a basket and a folded black tote on it. 2x2 tiles, faces north.
size: 32x32
